# EcrioniX — Commit + New Page Checklist

## After every edit session
- Always `git add` the relevant files, `git commit`, and `git push` to `origin` when the work is done.
- Do not leave finished edits uncommitted.
- Skip secrets / local-only files (`.env`, credentials, `.claude/settings.local.json` unless asked).
- Commit message style: short why-focused summary (e.g. `feat(ads): add AdSense and EthicalAds to new course pages`).

## Every HTML page (new or edited)
1. **Google Analytics (GA4) on EVERY page** — ID `G-XXZS8C1FLY` in `<head>`. Never skip. Never use `G-TMJQ8CNQKL`.
```html
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-XXZS8C1FLY"></script>
<script>window.dataLayer=window.dataLayer||[];function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}gtag('js',new Date());gtag('config','G-XXZS8C1FLY');</script>
```
2. **Google AdSense** `ca-pub-6672302762343789` in `<head>` on all public and premium content pages (articles, tools, labs, courses, lessons). Skip only `/admin/` and redirect stubs.
```html
<script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-6672302762343789" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
```
3. **EthicalAds** client script in `<head>` + stickybox below `<body>` + in-content slot before footer or between sections:
```html
<script async src="https://media.ethicalads.io/media/client/ethicalads.min.js"></script>
```
Stickybox below `<body>`:
```html
<div id="ea-content" data-ea-publisher="ecrionixorg" data-ea-type="image" data-ea-style="stickybox" class="raised adaptive-css" data-ea-keywords="vlsi|semiconductor|electronics|engineering|rtl|asic"></div>
```
4. **Open Graph** meta tags: `og:title`, `og:description`, `og:image`, `og:url`, `og:type`
5. Prefer `og:image` → `https://ecrionix.org/favicon1.png` unless a page-specific image exists
6. Visible breadcrumb nav (where site pattern uses it)
7. FAQPage JSON-LD + BreadcrumbList JSON-LD (public learning pages)
8. Copy buttons on code blocks + back-to-top when matching existing page patterns
9. Card on parent category index (if applicable)
10. IDX entry in root `index.html` (homepage search) when applicable
11. `sitemap.xml` entry in the **same commit** as the new page

## Premium / gated pages
- Still include GA4 + AdSense + EthicalAds + OG tags.
- Keep `noindex,follow` if that is the existing premium pattern.
- Include shared theme: early theme bootstrap + `/assets/theme-toggle.css` + `/assets/premium-theme.css` + `/assets/theme-toggle.js`, and a `#themeToggleSlot` in the navbar.
